									<p class="metasyncPara"> This technology upgrade not only improves operational efficiency by as much as 35% but also supports sustainability initiatives, with real-time energy monitoring helping businesses save on power consumption. The streamlined integration of wireless controls and IoT devices connects the <b>water</b> feature to building management systems, enhancing both functionality and user experience. </p>								</div>
